              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شرکت ده کارمند را اخراج کرد. sherkat dah kârmand râ ekhrâj kard. The company dismissed ten employees."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also to expel a pupil. The person takes râ."
            }
          ]
        },
