              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازنشستگی (bâzneshastegi) — \"retirement\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پدربزرگم بعد از بازنشستگی بیشتر کتاب میخواند. pedarbozorgam ba'd az bâzneshastegi bishtar ketâb mikhânad. Since he retired, my grandfather reads more."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From bâzneshaste \"retired\": bâz \"back\" + neshaste \"seated\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازنشستگی (bâzneshastegi) is native Persian, built from bâz \"back\" + neshaste, the participle of neshastan \"to sit\", + -gi. A retired person has sat back down."
            }
          ]
        },
